{
  "id": "u09-l07",
  "unit": "u09-past",
  "title": "Yesterday's story",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "Tell a story by chaining past verbs with **তারপর** 'then':\n\n**গতকাল আমি সকাল সাতটায় উঠলাম। তারপর নাস্তা করলাম। আমি বন্ধুর সাথে বাজারে গেলাম…**\n\n**সাথে** (*shathe*) 'with' is a postposition, so the noun is genitive: **বন্ধুর সাথে** 'with a friend'. In Kolkata **সঙ্গে** is more common.\n\nAnd round it off: **দিনটা খুব ভালো ছিল** 'It was a really good day'.\n\n**যখন … তখন …** \"when …, (then) …\" ties two events together. Don't mix up relative **যখন** with question **কখন**.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "uthlam",
      "bn": "উঠলাম",
      "tr": "uthlam",
      "en": "I got up"
    },
    {
      "id": "bondhur",
      "bn": "বন্ধুর",
      "tr": "bondhur",
      "en": "friend's"
    },
    {
      "id": "shathe",
      "bn": "সাথে",
      "tr": "shathe",
      "en": "with",
      "notes": "After a genitive: বন্ধুর সাথে 'with a friend'. Also সঙ্গে (shongge), more common in Kolkata."
    },
    {
      "id": "dinta",
      "bn": "দিনটা",
      "tr": "dinta",
      "en": "the day"
    },
    {
      "id": "jokhon",
      "bn": "যখন",
      "tr": "jokhon",
      "en": "when",
      "notes": "Relative \"when\" (not a question): যখন … তখন … \"when …, then …\". The question word is কখন."
    },
    {
      "id": "tokhon",
      "bn": "তখন",
      "tr": "tokhon",
      "en": "then"
    },
    {
      "id": "kotha-talk",
      "bn": "কথা",
      "tr": "kotha",
      "en": "talk",
      "notes": "কথা বলা = \"to talk, speak\". Don't confuse with কোথা \"where\" (কোথা থেকে)."
    }
  ],
